.TH ZORO-LINUX 7 "2026" "Zoro Linux 10" "Zoro Linux Manual"

.SH NAME
zoro\-linux \- overview of Zoro Linux 10 (Santoryu Edition)

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Zoro Linux
is a community-driven, enterprise-grade Linux distribution based on
Enterprise Linux 10. It is inspired by Roronoa Zoro from One Piece \(em
the swordsman who trains relentlessly, never breaks his vow, and cuts
through every obstacle with three-blade precision.

Zoro Linux carries the same ethos: ruthless performance, zero
unnecessary bloat, absolute reliability, and a visual identity as
sharp as Wado Ichimonji.

.SH THE THREE BLADES PHILOSOPHY
Zoro's Santoryu (Three-Sword Style) maps directly to Zoro Linux's
three core pillars:

.TP
.B Wado Ichimonji \(em Stability & Honour
LTS kernel, battle-tested packages, zero-surprise upgrades.

.TP
.B Sandai Kitetsu \(em Speed & Power
Optimised scheduler, aggressive I/O tuning, DNF5 fast package
manager, zstd-compressed RPMs.

.TP
.B Yubashiri / Shusui \(em Elegance & Craft
Zoro-themed GNOME/KDE shell, custom icon set, refined fonts,
thoughtful UX.

.SH INSTALLATION PROFILES
.TP
.B The Blade (Minimal)
Bare OS, CLI only, no GUI. Smallest attack surface.

.TP
.B The Strategist (Server)
Headless, sshd, Cockpit web console, server tools.

.TP
.B The Swordsman (Workstation)
Full GNOME desktop (ZoroDeck Shell), developer tools.

.TP
.B Santoryu Full (Dojo Edition)
Everything: GNOME + KDE + all Zoro themes and extras.

.TP
.B The Current (Container Host)
Podman, crun, CNI, container-optimised.

.SH REPOSITORIES
.TP
.B zoro-baseos
Core OS packages (enabled by default).

.TP
.B zoro-appstream
Applications and language runtimes (enabled by default).

.TP
.B zoro-extras
Community-maintained extras (enabled by default).

.TP
.B zoro-crb
Code Ready Builder (disabled by default).

.TP
.B zoro-dojo
Curated 3rd party applications (disabled by default).

.SH SECURITY
Zoro Linux ships with SELinux in enforcing mode and firewalld active.
Additional hardening can be applied using
.BR zoro-harden (8).

